{
  "id": "ssh-exec",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "kernelCompat": "^0.3.0",
  "description": "经本机 ssh 在远程主机上执行命令、拉取文件、列出可连主机（ssh.exec / ssh.fetch / ssh.hosts）。主机用 ~/.cak/ssh.json 里的别名，只走密钥（BatchMode 永不弹密码），远程命令由 argv 数组安全拼接，超时杀进程组。给运维 agent 查状态、看日志、重启服务、取配置用。",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "install": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/theyuyan/cak-plugins.git",
    "ref": "main",
    "subdir": "plugins/ssh-exec"
  },
  "entrypoint": {
    "type": "subprocess",
    "command": "node",
    "args": [
      "dist/main.js"
    ]
  },
  "contracts": [
    {
      "name": "ssh.hosts",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "sampleArgs": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "ssh.exec",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "sampleArgs": {
        "host": "example",
        "argv": ["uptime"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ssh.fetch",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "sampleArgs": {
        "host": "example",
        "remotePath": "/etc/hostname",
        "localPath": "hostname.txt"
      }
    }
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "ssh",
    "远程执行",
    "远程命令",
    "服务器",
    "运维",
    "拉文件",
    "scp",
    "取日志",
    "remote exec",
    "remote shell",
    "fetch file",
    "ops",
    "sysadmin",
    "linux"
  ],
  "setup": "本机要有 OpenSSH 客户端且已 ssh-copy-id 到目标机；写 ~/.cak/ssh.json：{\"allowRawHosts\":false,\"hosts\":{\"web1\":{\"target\":\"deploy@10.0.0.5\",\"identityFile\":\"~/.ssh/id_ed25519\",\"allowSudo\":false}}}（SSH_CONFIG 可改路径）。",
  "source": "https://github.com/theyuyan/cak-plugins/tree/main/plugins/ssh-exec",
  "tier": "T1"
}
